# Dev: Vite proxies `/api` → backend (`vite.config.ts`). Default proxy target when unset: `http://127.0.0.1:3801`.
# Docker Compose overrides this so the frontend container proxies to service `backend` on the Compose network.
#VITE_DEV_PROXY_TARGET=http://backend:3801

VITE_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:3801
